    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duɔl kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu tha̱a̱ŋ wutni ben kä Ju-dia, kä cukɛ ji̱ ŋäthä ŋi̱eec wäkɛ i̱, “/Ca yɛ dee kän ɛ ni mi ca yɛ cuɛl kɛ ciaŋ ŋuɔ̱tni Muthɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Puɔl kɛnɛ Bar-na-bäth gua̱c kɛ kɛ, kä cukɛ te kɛ ŋaknɔm mi di̱i̱t, cua Puɔl kɛnɛ Bar-na-bäth kɛ tha̱a̱ŋ nath kɔ̱kiɛn kuany kɛ ɣöö bikɛ wä kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm wäkɛ jaak Yecu kɛnɛ di̱t thiec kɛ kui̱ ruac ɛmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min, ci duel Kuɔth kɛ jäkä dupdiɛn, cukɛ rët kɛ Po-ni-cia kɛnɛ Tha-mɛ-ria, cukɛ jɛ lat ɛn ɣöö ci Jur rɔ̱ riet Kuoth, kä cu thuk ɛ tɔ̱ tɛ̈th lɔaac mi di̱i̱t nöŋ dämani diaal rɛy Kritho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cikɛ ben kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm cua kɛ nyuɔ̱ɔ̱r agɔaa ɛ duel Kuɔth kɛnɛ jaak kɛ di̱t, tëë cu kɛn kɛ la̱t ŋɔaani diaal tëë ci Kuoth kɛ la̱t kɛ kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu tha̱a̱ŋ ji̱ ŋäthä ti ji̱ Pa-ri-thii rɔ̱ jiɛc, kä cukɛ wee i̱, “Ɛ luɔt pa̱ny ɛn ɣöö bakɛ yi̱k cuɛl, kä bakɛ la̱t ɣöö bikɛ ŋut Muthɛ tit.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu jaak kɛnɛ di̱t rɔ̱ dol kɛɛl kɛ ɣöö ba ruac ɛmɛ car. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔr ruac mi di̱i̱t, cu Pi-tɔr rɔ jiɛc kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Dämaari, ŋäc yɛn ɛ ɛn ɣöö kɛ ni̱n tëë kɔn ci Kuoth mɛɛk rɛydun, kɛ ɣöö dee Jur thuk ti gɔw kɛ kui̱ Yecu liŋ thokdä, kä bikɛ ŋa̱th. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä Kuoth in ŋäc lo̱c nath cɛ kɛ ka̱m nën kɛ muɔ̱cdiɛn Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ, ce̱tkɛ mëë cɛ lät kä kɔn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä thilɛ dääk mi cɛ la̱t kamdan kɛ kɛ, cɛ cueerkiɛn päl kɛ ɣöö cikɛ ŋa̱th. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ, ɛ kui̱ ŋukä ɣɔ̱a̱nɛ Kuoth ɔ, kɛ käm ji̱ kɔaar Yecu la̱t mi bum mi /ci gua̱nikɔn kiɛ kɔn ɛ dee luäŋ kɛ ruɔ̱t? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ŋa̱thnɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö ba kɔn kän kɛ puɔ̱th baaŋ Kua̱r ni Yecu, ce̱tnikɛ kɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu duɔl kɛɛliw biɛt, kä liɛŋkɛ ruac Bar-na-bäth kɛnɛ Puɔl min latkɛ nyuuthni kɛnɛ ti ga̱ykɛ naath tëë ci Kuoth kɛ la̱t kɛ kɛ rɛy Juri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cikɛ thuɔ̱k kɛ ruac, cu Je-mɛth ruac wëë i̱, “Dämaari, liɛŋɛ ɣä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Thay-mɔn ɛ la̱r yɛ ɛn ɣöö ci Kuoth Jur nhɔk i̱di kɛ nhiam, kɛ ɣöö bɛ rɔɔdɛ kuëny naath rɛydiɛn kɛ kui̱ cio̱tädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛmɛ cɛ mat kɛ ruaacni göökni ce̱tkɛ mi ca gɔ̱r i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Warɛgak mi ca jäkä Jur tin ŋa̱th",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jaak Yecu kɛnɛ di̱t ji̱ dueel Kuɔth diaal jɛ mat ɛn ɣöö bikɛ naath kuany rɛydiɛn ti ba jäk kä Ɛ̈n-ti-ɔk kɛɛl kɛ Puɔl kɛnɛ Bar-na-bäth. Cukɛ Ju-däth mi cɔal i̱ Bar-tha-bath kɛnɛ Thay-läth ti la di̱t rɛy dämani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cua warɛgak ɛmɛ jak kɛ kɛ i̱, “Kɔn dämuɔɔri rɛy Kritho, tin la jaak kɛ di̱t, nërkɔ yɛ, yɛn dämaari tin la Jur kɛ di̱eth tin te kä Ɛ̈n-ti-ɔk, kɛnɛ Thi-ri-ya kɛ Thi-li-cia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɔn cakɔ jɛ liŋ ɛn ɣöö ci tha̱a̱ŋ nath kä kɔ yɛ wä jut kɛ rieet ti ŋuan, kä nyuɔnkɛ wuɔ̱thkun, kɛn thilɛ ruac mi cakɔ la̱t kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɔn cakɔ jɛ mat kɔn diaal ɛn ɣöö bakɔ wutni kuany kä ja̱kɛ kɛ kä yɛ kɛɛl kɛ Bar-na-bäth kɛnɛ Puɔl tin la mäthnikɔ tin gɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn wutni tin ca tëkdiɛn thöp kɛ kui̱ Kua̱ran ni Yecu Kritho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ cakɔ Ju-däth kɛnɛ Thay-läth ja̱k, tin kɛn pua̱nykiɛn ba yɛ la̱t ŋɔaani ti̱ti̱ kɛ thokdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ kɛ kɔn lat kɛ ɣöö thilɛ riɛk mi ba la̱th wi̱i̱dun, bia la̱t ni ti̱ti̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ɛ ɣöö cia bi mi̱th kä tin ca na̱k kuth baaŋ, kɛnɛ riɛm, kɛnɛ tin ca dɛc, kɛ ciaaŋ riäärä. Mi wiaa rɔ̱ wä tit kä kɛn ti̱ti̱ bia gɔw. Kua tekɛ mal.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua kɛ jakä wä, cukɛ wä kä Ɛ̈n-ti-ɔk. Kä mëë cikɛ ji̱ ŋäthä dol kɛɛl, cukɛ warɛgak thöp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cikɛ jɛ kuɛn cu lo̱ckiɛn tɛɛth kɛ ruac comä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ju-däth kɛnɛ Thay-läth tin la göök, cukɛ dämani com, kä cukɛ kɛ bum kɛ rieet ti ŋuan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr kä mëë cikɛ te wi̱ni, cua kɛ ja̱k kɛ mal ɛ dämani rɛy Kritho, lunydiɛn kä nɛy tëë ja̱kɛ kɛ. [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thay-läth ɛ car ɛn ɣöö bɛ duɔth.]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:34",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tha̱a̱ŋ buɔkni tëë wal cikɛ käth kä 34 mat thi̱n.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Puɔl kɛnɛ Bar-na-bäth duɔth kä Ɛ̈n-ti-ɔk, kɛ nɛy kɔ̱kiɛn ti ŋuan cukɛ naath ŋi̱eec kä latkɛ ruac Kua̱r ni Yecu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Däk Puɔl piny kɛnɛ Bar-na-bäth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔr ni̱ni cu Puɔl Bar-na-bäth jiök i̱, “Bër, kuanɛ loc jɔk, ban dämanikɔn wä gui̱l rɛy wi̱i̱ni diaal tëë can ruac Kua̱r ni Yecu lat thi̱n, kä banɛ ta̱a̱diɛn wä nɛn.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Bar-na-bäth jɛ go̱r ɛn ɣöö bikɛ Jɔ̱ɔ̱n in cɔal i̱ Mak naŋ kɛ kɛ kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Puɔl ɛ lar ɛn ɣöö /cikɛ ram mi cikɛ ba̱ny kä Pam-pi-lia bi naŋ kɛɛl kɛ kɛ, kä /ken wä lät kɛ kɛ kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kamdiɛn tekɛ gak a cukɛ rɔ̱ da̱a̱k. Cu Bar-na-bäth Mak naŋ kɛ jɛ kɛɛl, cuɛ wä kä Ki-ti-yim kɛ riey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Puɔl Thay-läth mɛk, kä cuɛ jiɛɛn, kä cu ji̱ ŋäthä ɛ la̱th rɛy puthä Kua̱r ni Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wä kä Thi-ri-ya kɛnɛ Thi-li-cia, bumɛ duël Kuɔth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
